        "Title": "47 and The Misguided Moniker",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN_NIGHT",
        "PublicId": "104765885860",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_mamba.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository bfbd8990-7356-4a2b-83f4-bc99ab6c35a6).Image",
        "Description": "Large events like this are always rife with skullduggery, or in this case: Thievery. \r\rYour target is a group of Burglars calling themselves &quot;Krazy Kanyon Kats&quot;. Insensitive moniker aside, they recently stole the plans for an Open Source Vaccine for Dengue Fever from a Hacker Space in Pretoria and are now planning to sell it through Abiatis Mafia contacts.\r\rDon&apos;t be fooled: They are known to disguise themselves in the field.\r\rAfter all these years, still a surprisingly uncommon tactic. Huh...",
